<title>UK: Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on U.S. Treasury.</title>
<headline>Swiss Bank Corp sets warrants on U.S. Treasury.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 60 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the 6.875 percent U.S. Treasury due 2025, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	  104.00	6.01 DEM	 5.03 PCT     26.23 X</p>
<p> CALL B	  106.00	4.88 DEM	 6.26 PCT     32.30 X</p>
<p> CALL C	  108.00	3.92 DEM	 7.60 PCT     40.21 X</p>
<p> PUT D	    96.00	4.08 DEM	 9.16 PCT     38.63 X</p>
<p> PUT E	    98.00	5.25 DEM	 7.95 PCT     23.85 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 08.JAN.97-15.JAN.98   PAYDATE	07.JAN.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT DDF		   MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> PRICES ARE ALSO AVAILABLE IN U.S. DOLLARS</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
